{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yZJKWg2BXIkpqf-2LkidZA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:16.338851+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yZJKWg2BXIkpqf-2LkidZA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/B0y9OibPYsS5U9RVoicG1QyGrbPR12Z6dt5P0Mib10d4ibkn1MUSbYvUdZpsPMOGm2tsK7G8ibVxLELibM8AP1e9Jegg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>目</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>录</span></strong></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><strong><span>1.学院简</span></strong><strong><span>介</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>2.接收推免生专业与招收计划</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>3.申请条件</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>4.申请流程</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>5.</span><strong><span><span>其他注意事项</span></span></strong></strong></span></p></section></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><span><br/></span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>一</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中国政法大学人文学院成立于2002年6月，设有哲学系、中文系、历史研究所、艺术教育发展中心以及法治文化研究所。学院拥有哲学一级学科博士学位点、法治文化（二级学科）博士学位点，并设有哲学、中国史、中国语言文学、法学等多个学科的硕士学位点，以及国际中文教育与博物馆学专业硕士学位点。其学科建设覆盖哲学、中国语言文学、历史学、法学、教育学等多个学科领域，是中国政法大学多学科建设的杰出代表。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院坚持“法大人文、人文法大”的办学理念，积极融入中国政法大学新文科建设的浪潮中，探索专业教育与书院教育相结合的创新育人模式，特别强调人文学科与法学学科的深度整合。硕士研究生教育以本院教师为主导，同时联合国际儒学院、法律古籍研究所、法律史学研究院等校内科研机构的教师共同参与，师资队伍强大，综合实力突出。目前，学院正在进行2026年推荐免试生申请攻读硕士研究生的报名工作，热忱欢迎2026届有志于深造的优秀本科生踊跃报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>师资团队详见中国政法大学人文学院官方网站：http://rwxy.cupl.edu.cn/</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>二</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收推免生专业与招收计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/B0y9OibPYsS5U9RVoicG1QyGrbPR12Z6dt4WmUd8uMB2RqW5bazRyl9Dc996dkTmCrmSEWwLiaibW0ZDeA3QEw4l7A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>为促进选拔优秀生源，2026年人文学院</span><strong><span>哲学专业实施“大类”招生</span></strong><span>改革，招生专业调整为一级学科，二级学科（原招生专业）调整为研究方向。</span></p><p><strong><span>支教保研、本硕贯通培养实验班等各类专项招生计划根据学校相关规定执行。</span></strong></p><p><span>复试考核范围以研究生院招生办公布的通知为准。</span></p><p><span>详见：https://yjsy.cupl.edu.cn/info/1020/12630.htm?sessionid=</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>三</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>4.符合我校硕士研究生招生章程中规定的报考条件（我校2026年招生章程发布前可参考2025年招生章程中的报考条件）。</span></p><p><span>5.申请人获得所在学校推免生资格（如所在学校尚未完成推免资格评定工作，但预计可取得推免生资格者，也可申请）。</span></p><p><span>6.成绩优秀，排名居本专业同年级学生前列。</span></p><p><span>7.考生申请专业（方向）应与本科所学专业（以教育部学信网注册学籍信息为准）相同或相近。我院部分学科（或方向）允许跨一级学科报考：</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/B0y9OibPYsS5U9RVoicG1QyGrbPR12Z6dtxPkCZZXlkJHicjyn25iceXnqWPnGz1wkjDMjjSMNjBU04bLnR0pmjAHg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>四</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span> 申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>网上报名</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（</span><span><span>1）报名截止时间：</span><strong><span>9月11日下午15:00</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）报名网址：https://yzbm.cupl.edu.cn/logon</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）报名流程：注册账号-&gt;填写申请信息-&gt;上传照片-&gt;上传材料-&gt;申请信息提交</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人应按以下材料清单及要求在报名系统中上传电子版申请材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）《申请免试攻读中国政法大学2026年硕士研究生登记表》（报名系统中下载）。为方便考生，报名系统中已提前置入本校学生综合素质评价排名（数据来自各学院公示排名），本校学生无需盖章（如后续排名发生变化，与系统内不一致的，可在登记表上修改并须加盖公章）。其他学校考生须按表中要求签字盖章。</span></p><p><span>（2）有效居民身份证，正反面扫描在同一页。</span></p><p><span>（3）有效期内的《教育部学籍在线验证报告》中文版，教育部学信网下载：https://www.chsi.com.cn/。</span></p><p><span>（4）本科前三学年成绩单（加盖申请人所在学校教务部门公章后扫描）。</span></p><p><span>（5）全国大学英语四级或六级、托福、雅思等考试成绩单或其他外语水平证明。</span></p><p><span>（6）校级以上（含校级）获奖证书、发表的论文或著作等（非必须材料）。</span></p><p><span>（7）学院要求提交的其他材料（学院自行确定，如有，将在报名系统中上传材料界面说明）。</span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>注意事项：</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）未按要求上传申请材料者，不予受理其申请。</span></p><p><span>（2）电子版申请材料上传要求：需用原件逐项扫描为单独jpg或pdf格式文件，请勿设置文件查看密码。</span></p><p><span>（3）每名申请人</span><strong><span>限报一个志愿</span></strong><span>，提交申请信息后，在报名时间截止前可随时修改。申请信息修改后，须重新点击提交。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请人须按要求</span><strong><span>准确填写</span></strong><span>个人网上报名信息并</span><strong><span>提供真实材料</span></strong><span>。申请人因网报信息填写错误、填报虚假信息而造成不能复试或录取的，后果由申请人本人承担。学校将严把资格审查关，对于弄虚作假者，无论何时，一经查实，严肃处理。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>五</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><span>关于报名等详情请参看我校研究生院官网《关于开展2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生报名工作的通知》。我校发布各类研究生招生信息及相关通知的网站为“中国政法大学研究生院”主页，网址：yjsy.cupl.edu.cn。</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><span>我校推免复试将于</span><strong><span>9月15日-20日</span></strong><span>进行，复试方式为</span><strong><span>现场复试</span></strong><span>，复试地点为</span><strong><span>我校海淀校区</span></strong><span>。具体安排详见我校研究生院和学院网站后续通知，请考生及时关注，做好行程安排。</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></td><td><section><p><span><strong><span>联系方式：</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>学院研究生办公室通信及办公地址：北京市海淀区西土城路25号中国政法大学科研楼B320办公室（邮政编码：100088）</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：010-58908216</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：宋老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：rwxyygb@cupl.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2f09a48d319776858f07c3905a781271802c74e83a786a93efe6057a85648c5e","textLength":2012,"sourceSha256":"75a0451ff501886e7d74600258d17057f73743b7e35175676616c8e89e5d2063","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ab745f00b078a52e7f54","title":"2025年中国政法大学人文学院2026年接收推荐免试生申请攻读硕士研究生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:16.338851+00:00"}
